From: proto0654 <proto0654@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:22:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(desktop): reveal_terminal_tab tool for
 background-process mirrors
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

terminal(background=true) already mirrors a process into the in-app terminal
pane, but the pane may be closed and the mirror's tab unselected. This adds a
desktop_ui tool that emits terminal.reveal for one process id and the renderer
handler that fronts that mirror tab — active session only, so a background turn
never steals the foreground. Never types into the shell.
